<Base title="The European Grand Tour Is Usually the Wrong Trip — Hit Your Mark Travel Journal" description="London, Paris, Rome, Florence, Venice, Barcelona in two weeks. It's the most common European itinerary and one of the least satisfying travel experiences available. Here is why — and what to do instead." active="journal" pageCss={pageCss} schemaType="article">
  <Fragment set:html={Content} />
</Base>
